nostrc (0.4.0-1) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * Wave 4 packaging (#22a): add the four new binary packages for the
    GNOME-integration + Samba-server milestones.
    - nostrc-session-relay: nostr-session-relayd + user socket/service.
    - nostr-notify: nostr-notify-daemon + user service.
    - nostr-dav: localhost CalDAV/CardDAV/WebDAV bridge + user service +
      D-Bus session activation for org.nostr.Dav.
    - nostrc-samba-server: dedicated smb.conf + smb-credentiald.conf +
      servers.d/example.conf + nostr-smbd.service + sysusers entry.
  * Enable BUILD_RELAYD, ENABLE_NOSTR_DAV and NOSTR_HOMED_ENABLE_SESSION_
    RELAY_UNITS in debian/rules; add GLib/libsoup/libxml2/json-glib/
    libsecret Build-Depends.
  * override_dh_installsystemd names nostr-smbd explicitly with
    --no-start --no-enable so an unseeded passdb never surfaces on
    TCP 445/139 by accident.
  * override_dh_auto_test now runs the pinned dep-purity gate
    (scripts/check-authd-dep-purity.sh) against nostr-authd + pam_nostr
    so package builds fail on any new hanami/porthome/nip55l/FUSE
    dependency edge.
  * ENABLE_NIP55L_STANDALONE_ACTIVATION explicit OFF; gnostr-signer's
    debian package remains the sole owner of org.nostr.Signer.service
    (Milestone-A D3 dedup).
  * Rename smb.conf.standalone.sample + smb-credentiald.conf.sample into
    /etc/nostr-auth/ as real conffiles; keep sample originals under
    /usr/share/nostr-homed/ for provenance.

 -- GNostr Project <gnostr@example.com>  Fri, 25 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000

nostrc (0.3.0-1) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * Initial Debian source package for the nostrc monorepo.
  * Phase 1 (nostrc-rb0e.3 D2, nostrc-rb0e.10 D9): headless
    nostr-login stack.
    - libnss-nostr: read-only NSS module (libnss_nostr.so.2).
    - libpam-nostr: broker-backed PAM module + pam-auth-update profile.
    - nostr-authd: auth broker daemon + hardened systemd unit.
    - nostr-homectl: headless identity-authority CLI (NOSTR_HOMED_ENABLE_CTL)
      plus nostr-homed-seed provisioning tool.
    - nostr-homed-smb: nostr-smb-acquire / nostr-smb-mount.
    - nostr-homed-domain: inert winbind samples + validator (arch:all).
    - nostr-login: metapackage.
  * Also ships the core runtime the login stack links against:
    libnostr1, libnostrgo0, libnostr-json1 and their -dev packages.
  * Built with NOSTR_WITH_GLIB=OFF so libnostr1 and the whole nostr-login
    Depends closure carry no GLib (D-14 headless ABI).

 -- GNostr Project <gnostr@example.com>  Tue, 22 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000
